  <ym-title|Actual stationary germ symmetry \V
  draft><label|actual-stationary-germ-symmetry--draft>

  Source pin3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464.
  Lean/YM/Next/STATIONARY/Joint/Symmetry.lean namespace YM.Stationary:
  gram_bend/rate_transfer, horn/quota_k/munition_law/gear_honors/honors_status/bounty_carry;
  spiral/wheel/regiment/fleet_act/rocket_s/muster_spin/troop_turn/sail/twistWorth;
  tribute_probe/tribute_wager/coin_tag/turn_tribute/gauge_tribute/tested_forced/campaign.
  Meaning of bounty from Joint/HaarJac.lean: 1/2 logdet medals - logdet
  grenade. Regulator.lean cannon \<mu\>=\<mu\>\<twosuperior\>pebble^9,
  grenade=tonic+cannon, cannonade=mail^T rear+cannon indexX. New text calls
  cannonade F, medals M, grenade \<Gamma\>; all real matrices at fixed
  fields.

  Reuses stationary-action-prices selected tag germ/graph and
  thermal-contact-cancellation moving Haar determinant identity. Audit point:
  gauge-back uniqueness only original rooted chart, not all centered
  stationary representatives; signed tangent contains field-dependent adjoint
  on reversed link but is frozen while differentiating increments. Full
  completed bounty signed covariance is distinct from unsigned-only fine
  auxiliary pole symmetry.

  Targeted source reads actually run; no fresh Lean build/axiom replay/source
  edits. Shared literature index: source-specific finite matrix/germ
  argument, elementary chain rule and determinant facts; no external
  reference invoked. Independent review pending.

  Independent bounded draft pass: f11327cfde532dd8b1a5510ff577d2bbad8995a2abf95189d4faf52a219abcd5.
  Machine review status remains draft.

